        POST /categories (Create "Food")
        GET /categories (List all)
    [done] Expenses API:
        POST /expenses (Must include categoryId)
        GET /expenses (List all)
    [done] Bonus Logic: When getting expenses, use Prisma's include: { category: true } so the response shows "Food" instead of just ID 1.
    
