    [ ] Challenge: Use the Nginx reverse proxy setup we discussed but didn't finish. Try to put Nginx in front of your API.

Phase 7: CI/CD (GitHub Actions)
    [ ] Create the .github/workflows/pipeline.yml.
    [ ] Job 1: Lint & Test.
    [ ] Job 2: Build & Push to Docker Hub.
    [ ] Bonus: If you feel brave, try to set up Watchtower on the server to auto-update the app.


Why this project?
    Relations: You can't just delete a Category if it has Expenses inside it! (Prisma will throw an error). You have to handle that.
    Numbers: Dealing with money (Floats/Decimals) in Zod and Prisma is slightly different than strings.
    Real World: Every company has "Relationships" in their data.